# Implementation Plan - KONSTANZ Event Finder App (Mobile & Web Frontend)

Build the exact pixel-perfect frontend UI for **KONSTANZ**, a modern event & nightlife discovery application. The implementation will mirror the design screenshots provided in `client/assests/mobile-view` and `client/assests/browser-view` using **Next.js (App Router)**, **Tailwind CSS**, **shadcn/ui**, **Lucide Icons**, and custom typography.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Responsive & Dual-View Switcher:**
> The design has distinct layouts for mobile devices (with bottom navigation bar and compact vertical stacks) and desktop web browsers (with top navigation bar, multi-column grid, and desktop sidebar action panels).
> We will implement a responsive structure that automatically adapts based on screen size, and include a floating **View Toggle (Mobile View / Web View)** so you can preview both exact designs on any screen size.

> [!NOTE]
> **Animations:**
> Per instructions, animations are explicitly excluded for this initial phase, focusing purely on exact visual layouts, typography, sizes, colors, and mock data accuracy.

---

## Proposed Architecture & Design System

### 1. Design Tokens & Styling
- **Theme**: Dark Nightlife / Neon Night theme.
- **Background**: `#070708` / `#0D0D0E` / `#121214`
- **Cards & Containers**: `#18181C` / `#1E1E24` with subtle borders (`#27272A`).
- **Primary Accent**: Neon Yellow / Lime (`#CCFF00` / `hsl(72, 100%, 50%)`).
- **Typography**:
  - **Logo & Display Headers**: Bold Condensed Font (`Bebas Neue` / `Oswald` / `Syne`).
  - **Body & Controls**: Clean modern sans-serif (`Inter` / `Geist`).
- **Icons**: `lucide-react` (MapPin, Calendar, Clock, Ticket, Heart, Bookmark, Compass, Share, ExternalLink, Search, Filter, Cap, PartyPopper, Globe, Utensils, Music).

---

## Component & Screen Breakdown

### 1. Header & Navigation Components
- `HeaderWeb`: Top navigation bar with logo "KONSTANZ", center nav links (`Home`, `Discover`, `Weekend`, `Saved`), right search icon and user profile avatar with dropdown.
- `HeaderMobile`: Top bar with logo "KONSTANZ" in neon yellow, location selector ("Konstanz"), search button, profile avatar.
- `BottomNavMobile`: Fixed bottom tab bar with 4 tabs (`Home`, `Discover`, `Weekend`, `Saved`) featuring active neon yellow pill indicators.

### 2. Screen Views (Supported in both Mobile & Web variants)

#### A. Home Screen (`/`)
- **Web**:
  - Subtitle: "TONIGHT · FRIDAY" (Yellow uppercase).
  - Wide Hero Banner: "Techno Friday" at Blechnerei with "€8" neon tag and "Save" button.
  - Section "THIS WEEKEND": 3-column card grid (Student Night, Hip-Hop Party, Live Music Night).
  - Section "POPULAR": 4-column compact cards (House Saturday, Sommerfest, R&B Late Night, Open Deck).
  - Category Filter Pills: `Student` (active yellow fill), `Party`, `Club`, `Bar`, `Live Music`, `Culture`.
- **Mobile**:
  - Day selector pills (`Today`, `Tomorrow`, `Fri`, `Sat`, `Sun`).
  - Featured event card overlay with disco ball artwork ("Student Night" €5).
  - Section "This Weekend" (horizontal scroll view).
  - Category filter pills at bottom.

#### B. Discover Screen (`/discover`)
- **Search & Filter Bar**: Input field + View Mode segmented toggle (List / Map).
- **Filter Chips**: Dropdown filters (`Date ⌵`, `Category ⌵`, `Music ⌵`, `Price ⌵`, `Distance ⌵`). Active pills turn neon yellow with close `✕` buttons.
- **Card Grid / List**:
  - Web: 3-column layout of event cards with high-res thumbnails, price tags, category tags, and bookmark/like buttons.
  - Mobile: Vertical stack with landscape thumbnails on the left and event info + tags on the right.
- **Interactive Dark Map Section**: Dark map styled container with green neon pin markers and floating venue preview overlay card ("Blechnerei - Popular · 3 upcoming events").

#### C. Weekend Planner Screen (`/weekend`)
- **Header**: "My Weekend - Plan your nights out".
- **Day Selector Tabs**: `Today`, `Tomorrow`, `Fri`, `Sat` (active), `Sun`.
- **Timeline Schedule Block**: Vertical timeline line with glowing green node markers, showing scheduled events by hour (`22:00`, `23:30`, `01:00`).
- **Summary Metrics Bar (Web)**: 3-stat box (`3 events`, `€15 total`, `1 free`).
- **Sunday Reminder Banner**: "Nothing saved for Sunday yet" card with "Find something" neon button.

#### D. Event Detail Screen (`/event/[id]`)
- **Hero Image Banner**: Full-bleed nightclub background image with title "Student Night", venue "Club XYZ", and category tags (`Hip-Hop`, `R&B`).
- **Metadata Card Grid (4 columns)**: Date ("Saturday, August 29"), Time ("22:00"), Price ("€5"), Ticket Type ("Student").
- **Description Box**: Summary text + "View original event" link with external icon.
- **Venue & Map Card**: "Club XYZ - Konstanz" with map preview & "Open map" link.
- **Action Panel**: Prominent neon yellow "Save" button and "Share" outline button.
- **"MORE THIS WEEKEND" Section**: Related events recommendation row.

---

## Mock Data Structure (`src/data/mockEvents.ts`)

```typescript
export interface EventItem {
  id: string;
  title: string;
  venue: string;
  city: string;
  date: string;
  time: string;
  price: string;
  isFree?: boolean;
  category: 'Student' | 'Party' | 'Club' | 'Bar' | 'Live Music' | 'Culture';
  tags: string[];
  image: string;
  description: string;
  isSaved?: boolean;
  isPopular?: boolean;
  isFeatured?: boolean;
  lat?: number;
  lng?: number;
}
```

Sample Dataset includes all events from screenshots:
- `Student Night` (Club XYZ, €5, Hip-Hop / R&B)
- `Techno Friday` (Blechnerei, €8, Techno / Industrial)
- `Live Music Night` (Bar Central, Free, Indie / Rock)
- `House Saturday` (Kulturhaus, €5, House / Disco)
- `Hip-Hop Party` (Hafenbar, €5, Hip-Hop)
- `Summer Opening` (Club XYZ, €10, EDM / Pop)
- `Sommerfest` (Student Club, 20:00)
- `R&B Late Night` (Bar Central, €5, R&B)
- `Open Deck` (K9 Konstanz, Free, Techno)
- `Afterparty` (Bar Central, Free)
- `House Sundays` (Kulturhaus, €5)

