## Proposed Changes & File Structure

We will initialize and construct the application inside `/Users/moa/Documents/nextjs/party/client`:

```
party/client/
├── public/
│   └── images/          # Event & UI static images
├── src/
│   ├── app/
│   │   ├── layout.tsx   # Root layout with fonts, theme, & viewport switcher
│   │   ├── page.tsx     # Home Page
│   │   ├── discover/
│   │   │   └── page.tsx # Discover Page
│   │   ├── weekend/
│   │   │   └── page.tsx # Weekend Planner Page
