## Verification Plan

### Automated & Dev Server Verification
- Build and start local dev server (`npm run dev`).
- Verify Next.js page compilation and route navigation without runtime or syntax errors.

### Visual & Pixel Match Verification
- Test Home, Discover, Weekend, and Event Detail pages against the design mockups in `client/assests/mobile-view` and `client/assests/browser-view`.
- Use the built-in Viewport Switcher to toggle between Mobile layout and Web layout.
- Check layout responsiveness, font sizes, colors, icons, badge styling, dark background contrast, and image scaling.
